  "overview": "This is about Adam (45) owns a kennel. He is a profoundly good and generous, almost naive, man who struggles with depression and eco-anxiety. Via the technical support number for a light therapy lamp he recently purchased, he meets Tina (45), a settled, incredibly sweet mother from northern Ontario. They talk for many hours on the phone. When they meet, everything is turned upside down: Adam confronts his castrating father, Tina leaves her husband and children, LSD is consumed, businesses explode, dogs are released. In short, they are in love.",
